        <mxCell id="env_local" value="«boundary» &lt;b&gt;Environment 1: Local Development&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• DB Docker (&lt;i&gt;npm run docker:up&lt;/i&gt; → :5432) + Host Node (&lt;i&gt;npm run dev:backend :3001&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;dev:frontend :3000&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• Ở localhost, &lt;i&gt;lib/api.ts&lt;/i&gt; gọi trực tiếp &lt;i&gt;http://127.0.0.1:3001/api&lt;/i&gt; và Swagger tại &lt;i&gt;/api/docs&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Khởi tạo dữ liệu mẫu nhanh qua &lt;i&gt;npm run setup&lt;/i&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;i&gt;npm run clean:db&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;dashed=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="1080" width="510" height="112" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="env_ci" value="«boundary» &lt;b&gt;Environment 2: Mobile QR Demo Tunnel&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Chạy &lt;i&gt;npm run phone&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;i&gt;scripts/tunnel.js&lt;/i&gt;) mở tunnel HTTPS tạm tới &lt;i&gt;localhost:3000&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Điện thoại quét mã QR trên terminal để mở trang &lt;i&gt;/mbbank&lt;/i&gt; giả lập chuyển khoản&lt;br&gt;• Next.js rewrite &lt;i&gt;/api/:path*&lt;/i&gt; chuyển tiếp về NestJS Backend cục bộ (:3001)" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;dashed=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="550" y="1080" width="515" height="112" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="env_prod" value="«boundary» &lt;b&gt;Environment 3: Docker Compose Stack (3 Containers)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Chạy trọn bộ cục bộ qua &lt;i&gt;npm run docker:all&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;i&gt;docker-compose.yml&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• Cô lập &lt;i&gt;brewlite_frontend :3000 → brewlite_backend :3001 ↔ brewlite_postgres :5432&lt;/i&gt; trong &lt;i&gt;brewlite_network&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Volume bền vững &lt;i&gt;brewlite_postgres_data&lt;/i&gt;, kiểm tra sức khỏe qua &lt;i&gt;/api/health&lt;/i&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;i&gt;AllExceptionsFilter&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;dashed=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1085" y="1080" width="510" height="112" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
